"{\"new_string\":\"- Dependencies: none — the lockfile currently pins only the root package. Any dependency added in the future must be declared in `package.json` with an exact pinned version (no `^` or `~` ranges); `npm install --package-lock-only` then pins the full resolved graph in `package-lock.json`, including every transitive version and its integrity hash.\",\"old_string\":\"- Dependencies: none. Any dependency added in the future must be declared in `package.json` with an exact pinned version (no `^` or `~` ranges) so dependency inputs stay reproducible.\",\"path\":\"README.md\"}"